+## Beignet 0.43.6
+
+The source baseline is upstream tag `v0.43.6`, commit `b60b9d22d40a12a3cd45e1cff096c6146aadad26`. The portable fork started at `c90f5f0`. The 86 upstream source files changed since `fbdd109e` were merged using Git's three-way patch application. The prior portable changes still apply across the same 25 source files, including transport routing, SQLite writes, saved invoices, and mobile peer lifecycle. Upstream kept the same package dependencies.
+
+The sections below record the history of those patches.
+
