-Source baseline: upstream Beignet `0.41.0`, commit `fbdd109e` (full source commit recorded in `package.json`). The baseline is recorded in `package.json` (`upstreamVersion`, `upstreamCommit`) and substituted into the bundle at build time, so `GET /api/config` reports `0.41.0-portable` rather than a hand-maintained string. Upstream documentation is preserved in [README.upstream.md](README.upstream.md); the original CLI/package exports described there are **not** this package's exports. MIT license retained.
+The engine uses upstream Beignet `0.43.6`, commit `b60b9d22`. The build reads the full commit and version from `package.json` and reports `0.43.6-portable` at `GET /api/config`. See [README.upstream.md](README.upstream.md) for the upstream documentation and [PATCHES.md](PATCHES.md) for this fork's platform adaptations.
