-# Portable engine validation, 2026-11-15 addendum for 0.41.0
+# Portable engine validation, Beignet 0.43.6
+
+Tested on Node 24.22.1 against upstream tag `v0.43.6`. All 315 portable tests passed, including the loopback WebSocket transport test. The public TypeScript declarations passed `npm run check:types`. The ESM bundle reports `0.43.6-portable`.
+
+The difference between the merged source and upstream covers the same 25 files, with the same added and removed lines, as the difference between portable `c90f5f0` and its original upstream baseline `fbdd109e`. The node database schema version remains 20.
+
+The build records injected import paths relative to the source checkout in its esbuild metadata, so the package can be reproduced in another directory.
+
+## 2026-11-15 addendum for 0.41.0
